### 测试 Crawler API

### 1. GET 请求
GET http://localhost:3000/api/crawler?url=https://example.com

### 2. POST 请求
POST http://localhost:3000/api/crawler
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com"
}

### 3. POST 请求 (测试复杂页面，例如 Next.js 官网)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/crawler
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://nextjs.org"
}
